# Blade UI

Keep screens simple, readable, and usable on a phone.

## Layout

- One shared layout: `layouts/app.blade.php` — navbar, flash alerts, `@yield('content')`, footer.
- Use Bootstrap grid: `container`, `row`, `col-12` first, then `md` / `lg` for desktop.
- Minimal custom CSS (CSS variables for brand colors only). No heavy animations.

## Forms & Lists

- Only the fields we need (food name, category, quantity, expiry, address).
- Cards only when they help a form or list. Plain tables/lists are fine.
- Button labels stay plain: “Post donation”, “Claim food”, “Mark as delivered”.

## JavaScript

- Tiny plain JS only (confirm delete, toggle password, basic checks). No JS frameworks.

```blade
{{-- ❌ BAD — fixed desktop columns, no mobile stack --}}
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-3">...</div>
  <div class="col-9">...</div>
</div>

{{-- ✅ GOOD — mobile first --}}
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">...</div>
  <div class="col-12 col-md-8">...</div>
</div>
```
